# Runtime configuration

All settings live in `config/config.json`. The same keys are overridable via
environment variables for secret-free, per-run control:

| Env var | JSON key | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| ATDS_SEED | seed | random seed (default 42) |
| ATDS_MIN_ANIME | min_anime_titles | minimum unique titles gate |
| ATDS_TARGET_ANIME | target_anime_titles | stretch target |
| ATDS_MAX_RUNTIME_HOURS | max_runtime_hours | overall cap |
| ATDS_MAX_RUNTIME_ANILIST | max_source_runtime_hours.anilist | per-source cap |
| ATDS_MAX_RUNTIME_KITSU | max_source_runtime_hours.kitsu | per-source cap |
| ATDS_MAX_RUNTIME_SHIKIMORI | max_source_runtime_hours.shikimori | per-source cap |
| ATDS_MAX_RUNTIME_WIKIDATA | max_source_runtime_hours.wikidata | per-source cap |
| ATDS_MAX_RUNTIME_ANN | max_source_runtime_hours.ann | per-source cap |
| ATDS_CHECKPOINT_INTERVAL | checkpoint_interval | cadence for progress save |
| ATDS_ANILIST_RPM | anilist.per_minute | AniList requests/minute |
| ATDS_KITSU_RPS | kitsu.per_second | Kitsu requests/second |
| ATDS_SHIKIMORI_RPS | shikimori.per_second | Shikimori requests/second |
| ATDS_WIKIDATA_RPS | wikidata.per_second | Wikidata requests/second |
| ATDS_ANN_RPS | ann.per_second | ANN requests/second |

Copy this file to a real env file and fill only what you need:

```bash
cp config/.env.example .env
```

No secret is required by the default source set (all are keyless public APIs).
If a future source needs a key, store it in the environment — never in code
or config committed to Git.